---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config';
---
<Base title="About" description={`About ${SITE.name}: free, private tools that run in your browser.`}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is a collection of free tools for everyday media tasks: transcribing audio, generating subtitles,
      and more on the way. Every tool is built on one principle: <strong>your files should never have to leave your
      device</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Modern browsers can run AI models and media processing locally using WebGPU and WebAssembly. We use that to build
      tools that are as capable as paid cloud services, without uploads, accounts or usage limits.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site is built and maintained by an IT specialist with a background in enterprise infrastructure and
      information security (ISO 27001). Privacy-by-design is not a marketing line here; it is how the tools are built.
    </p>
    <p>Have a suggestion for a new tool? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
